[gd_scene format=3]

; The Sanctum, west of the Vault (map offset (170.5, -104)): the last chapel of the frozen layer, warmer than the
; archive: the stone here is dry, and the forbidden door at its west end breathes heat from below. A pilgrim shrine by
; the east door. Before the forbidden door kneels the Hierarch, the priest-machine that keeps it: coming near, the pilgrim
; hears its order to turn back, and the second law holds it at the door (a veil of glyphs, the law's words); pressing on
; breaks the law, and the door is open: down a stair to the Kiln, the volcanic layer.

